1
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:12,950
Respect for citizenship
is strong in our Ethiopia;

2
00:00:12,950 --> 00:00:23,100
National pride is seen, shining
from one side to another.

3
00:00:23,100 --> 00:00:29,400
For peace, for love,
for the freedom of peoples,

4
00:00:29,410 --> 00:00:35,800
In equality and in love
we stand united.

5
00:00:35,800 --> 00:00:42,200
Firm of foundation,
we respect humanness;

6
00:00:42,200 --> 00:00:48,012
We are people who live through cart.

7
00:00:49,012 --> 00:00:56,400
Wonderful is the stage of tradition,
mistress of a proud heritage,

8
00:00:56,400 --> 00:01:04,400
Natural grace, mother of a valorous people.

9
00:01:04,400 --> 00:01:12,150
We shall protect you - we have a duty;

10
00:01:12,150 --> 00:01:23,000
Our Ethiopia, live!
And let us be proud of you!